#. graduationTracks.ordinary.title
#: src/data/careers.js:7
msgctxt "text:graduationTracks.ordinary.title"
msgid "Ordinary four/six-year record"
msgstr "四年／六年通常学籍"

#. graduationTracks.ordinary.note
#: src/data/careers.js:8
msgctxt "text:graduationTracks.ordinary.note"
msgid "Dates follow the academic calendar. Incident days may be annotated, not torn out."
msgstr "日付は学務暦どおり。異変日は注記可、頁ごとの削除は不可。"

#. graduationTracks.long-lived.title
#: src/data/careers.js:13
msgctxt "text:graduationTracks.long-lived.title"
msgid "Forty-year long-lived track"
msgstr "長命種四十年制"

#. graduationTracks.long-lived.note
#: src/data/careers.js:14
msgctxt "text:graduationTracks.long-lived.note"
msgid "Credits are not discounted; only “next term” may continue for thirty-nine years."
msgstr "単位は割引なし。「来学期に」の上限だけ39年へ延長。"

#. graduationTracks.fairy-repeat.title
#: src/data/careers.js:19
msgctxt "text:graduationTracks.fairy-repeat.title"
msgid "Fairy repeat-graduation record"
msgstr "妖精反復卒業籍"

#. graduationTracks.fairy-repeat.note
#: src/data/careers.js:20
msgctxt "text:graduationTracks.fairy-repeat.note"
msgid ""
"Forgetting graduation does not revoke it; one ceremony may reissue at most "
"three wreaths."
msgstr "卒業を忘れても学位は取消されない。同一式典の花輪再交付は三回まで。"

#. graduationTracks.chronology-dispute.title
#: src/data/careers.js:25
msgctxt "text:graduationTracks.chronology-dispute.title"
msgid "Chronology-dispute record"
msgstr "年代逆転異議籍"

#. graduationTracks.chronology-dispute.note
#: src/data/careers.js:26
msgctxt "text:graduationTracks.chronology-dispute.note"
msgid "Graduation may precede admission, but both dates print in different inks."
msgstr "卒業年が入学年より前でも可。ただし証書は二色の墨で両日を印刷。"

#. careerOpenings.0.0.institution
#: src/data/careers.js:43
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.0.0.institution"
msgid "Hakurei Shrine Boundary & Donation-Box Duty"
msgstr "博麗神社・境界と賽銭箱合同当番"

#. careerOpenings.0.0.title
#: src/data/careers.js:44
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.0.0.title"
msgid "Boundary patrol & salary-not-guaranteed clerk"
msgstr "境界巡回兼・給与保証なし事務"

#. careerOpenings.0.0.host
#: src/data/careers.js:45
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.0.0.host"
msgid "Reimu Hakurei"
msgstr "博麗霊夢"

#. careerOpenings.0.0.region
#: src/data/careers.js:46
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.0.0.region"
msgid "Hakurei Shrine"
msgstr "博麗神社"

#. careerOpenings.0.0.premise
#: src/data/careers.js:53
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.0.0.premise"
msgid ""
"Patrol the boundary, draw visitor exits, and prove the wrench in the "
"donation box is not payroll."
msgstr "境界巡回、参拝者の退路作図、賽銭箱に突然入ったレンチが給与でないことの立証。"

#. careerOpenings.0.0.duties.0
#: src/data/careers.js:55
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.0.0.duties.0"
msgid "Record three boundaries Yukari did not move"
msgstr "紫に動かされなかった境界を三本記録"

#. careerOpenings.0.0.duties.1
#: src/data/careers.js:56
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.0.0.duties.1"
msgid "Separate lost property from offerings into at least two boxes"
msgstr "遺失物と賽銭を最低二箱へ分別"

#. careerOpenings.0.0.duties.2
#: src/data/careers.js:57
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.0.0.duties.2"
msgid "Find an exit still usable before the feast"
msgstr "宴会前に使える非常口を確認"

#. careerOpenings.0.0.friction
#: src/data/careers.js:59
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.0.0.friction"
msgid ""
"Reimu may rewrite “necessary but troublesome” as “tomorrow”; Yukari may "
"prove the route never belonged to today."
msgstr "霊夢は「必要だが面倒」を「明日」に直し、紫は巡回路が今日に属さないと証明し得る。"

#. careerOpenings.0.0.boundary
#: src/data/careers.js:60
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.0.0.boundary"
msgid "Do not widen a rift to create work."
msgstr "仕事量を作るため裂け目を拡大しない。"

#. careerOpenings.0.0.interview
#: src/data/careers.js:61
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.0.0.interview"
msgid "If the donation box and boundary vanish together, which do you log first?"
msgstr "賽銭箱と結界が同時に消えたら、どちらを先に記録する？"

#. careerOpenings.1.0.institution
#: src/data/careers.js:67
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.1.0.institution"
msgid "Scarlet Devil Mansion Zero-Minute Night Archive"
msgstr "紅魔館・零分夜間文書室"

#. careerOpenings.1.0.title
#: src/data/careers.js:68
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.1.0.title"
msgid "Night archivist & stopped-time observer"
msgstr "夜間記録員兼・停止時間観察者"

#. careerOpenings.1.0.host
#: src/data/careers.js:69
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.1.0.host"
msgid "Sakuya Izayoi / Patchouli Knowledge"
msgstr "十六夜咲夜／パチュリー・ノーレッジ"

#. careerOpenings.1.0.region
#: src/data/careers.js:70
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.1.0.region"
msgid "Scarlet Devil Mansion"
msgstr "紅魔館"

#. careerOpenings.1.0.premise
#: src/data/careers.js:77
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.1.0.premise"
msgid "Arrange duty logs with perfect order and zero elapsed time; tea may outlast the shift."
msgstr "順序は完全だが経過0分の当直簿を整理。休憩が勤務全体より長い場合あり。"

#. careerOpenings.1.0.duties.0
#: src/data/careers.js:79
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.1.0.duties.0"
msgid "Retain timestamps before and after a stop"
msgstr "停止前後の二時刻を保存"

#. careerOpenings.1.0.duties.1
#: src/data/careers.js:80
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.1.0.duties.1"
msgid "Log the path of shelving grimoires"
msgstr "移動する魔導書の進路を記録"

#. careerOpenings.1.0.duties.2
#: src/data/careers.js:81
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.1.0.duties.2"
msgid "Do not convert a vampire's “later” into human minutes"
msgstr "吸血鬼の「後で」を人間の分へ換算しない"

#. careerOpenings.1.0.friction
#: src/data/careers.js:83
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.1.0.friction"
msgid ""
"Sakuya's record is punctual even when time is not; Patchouli rejects “the "
"book walked” as complete provenance."
msgstr "咲夜の記録は定刻でも時間はそうとは限らず、パチュリーは「本が歩いた」を完全な来歴と認めない。"

#. careerOpenings.1.0.boundary
#: src/data/careers.js:84
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.1.0.boundary"
msgid "Never backfill consent during stopped time."
msgstr "停止時間中に同意署名を代筆しない。"

#. careerOpenings.1.0.interview
#: src/data/careers.js:85
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.1.0.interview"
msgid "Eight hours of work finish in zero minutes. What do you record?"
msgstr "0分で8時間分を完了。勤務時間は何時間と書く？"

#. careerOpenings.2.0.institution
#: src/data/careers.js:91
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.2.0.institution"
msgid "Eientei Cross-Species Night Clinic"
msgstr "永遠亭・種族横断夜診"

#. careerOpenings.2.0.title
#: src/data/careers.js:92
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.2.0.title"
msgid "Lunar handover & bamboo emergency coordinator"
msgstr "月相引継ぎ・竹林救急調整"

#. careerOpenings.2.0.host
#: src/data/careers.js:93
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.2.0.host"
msgid "Eirin Yagokoro / Reisen"
msgstr "八意永琳／鈴仙"

#. careerOpenings.2.0.region
#: src/data/careers.js:94
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.2.0.region"
msgid "Eientei & Bamboo Forest"
msgstr "永遠亭・迷いの竹林"

#. careerOpenings.2.0.premise
#: src/data/careers.js:101
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.2.0.premise"
msgid "Keep different pulses, wings, life states, and lunar responses distinct on one handover."
msgstr "異なる脈・翼・生死・月相反応を一枚の引継票で別々に読めるようにする。"

#. careerOpenings.2.0.duties.0
#: src/data/careers.js:103
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.2.0.duties.0"
msgid "Complete handover under full and non-full moons"
msgstr "満月・非満月で各一回引継ぎ"

#. careerOpenings.2.0.duties.1
#: src/data/careers.js:104
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.2.0.duties.1"
msgid "Retain a lost patient's original direction statement"
msgstr "迷子の元の方向陳述を保存"

#. careerOpenings.2.0.duties.2
#: src/data/careers.js:105
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.2.0.duties.2"
msgid "Rewrite permanent efficacy as stoppable observation"
msgstr "永久効果を停止可能な観察へ直す"

#. careerOpenings.2.0.friction
#: src/data/careers.js:107
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.2.0.friction"
msgid "Eirin asks whom “permanent” applies to; rabbit transit may depart before the form signs."
msgstr "永琳は「永久」が誰に対してかを問い、兎便は受領前に出発し得る。"

#. careerOpenings.2.0.boundary
#: src/data/careers.js:108
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.2.0.boundary"
msgid "Hourai components are not employee benefits."
msgstr "蓬莱成分を福利厚生として持ち帰らない。"

#. careerOpenings.2.0.interview
#: src/data/careers.js:109
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.2.0.interview"
msgid "A patient says they became immortal yesterday. Ask date or dose first?"
msgstr "患者が「昨日不死になった」と言う。日付と用量、どちらを先に聞く？"

#. careerOpenings.3.0.institution
#: src/data/careers.js:115
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.3.0.institution"
msgid "Kappa Workshop Village Public Trial Desk"
msgstr "河童工房・人里公共試運転席"

#. careerOpenings.3.0.title
#: src/data/careers.js:116
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.3.0.title"
msgid "Tape-batch & user-button engineer"
msgstr "テープロット・利用者ボタン技師"

#. careerOpenings.3.0.host
#: src/data/careers.js:117
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.3.0.host"
msgid "Nitori Kawashiro"
msgstr "河城にとり"

#. careerOpenings.3.0.region
#: src/data/careers.js:118
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.3.0.region"
msgid "Youkai Mountain Ravine / Human Village"
msgstr "妖怪山渓谷／人里"

#. careerOpenings.3.0.premise
#: src/data/careers.js:125
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.3.0.premise"
msgid ""
"Turn smoking prototypes into public equipment villagers can open, repair, "
"and press themselves."
msgstr "煙の出る試作を、開けて修理でき、里人が自分で押せる公共設備へ。"

#. careerOpenings.3.0.duties.0
#: src/data/careers.js:127
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.3.0.duties.0"
msgid "Attach units, time, and tape batch to every number"
msgstr "全数値に単位・時刻・テープロット"

#. careerOpenings.3.0.duties.1
#: src/data/careers.js:128
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.3.0.duties.1"
msgid "Run one trial with an actual user"
msgstr "実利用者による試運転を一回実施"

#. careerOpenings.3.0.duties.2
#: src/data/careers.js:129
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.3.0.duties.2"
msgid "Retain the failure day caused by a reversed part"
msgstr "逆向部品による故障日を保存"

#. careerOpenings.3.0.friction
#: src/data/careers.js:131
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.3.0.friction"
msgid ""
"Nitori calls temporary patches Production v2; if the machine repairs another "
"machine, rewrite the brief."
msgstr "にとりは仮補修を第2量産版と呼ぶ。装置が別機を直したら要件を書き直す。"

#. careerOpenings.3.0.boundary
#: src/data/careers.js:132
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.3.0.boundary"
msgid "A kappa demo cannot replace village user testing."
msgstr "河童実演は里人の利用者試験を代替しない。"

#. careerOpenings.3.0.interview
#: src/data/careers.js:133
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.3.0.interview"
msgid "A box smokes normally but will not open. Is it repairable?"
msgstr "箱は正常に煙を出すが開かない。整備可能か？"

#. careerOpenings.4.0.institution
#: src/data/careers.js:139
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.4.0.institution"
msgid "Bunbunmaru Public Corrections Desk"
msgstr "文々。新聞・公開訂正台"

#. careerOpenings.4.0.title
#: src/data/careers.js:140
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.4.0.title"
msgid "Extra-edition version & right-of-reply editor"
msgstr "号外版管理・反論権編集"

#. careerOpenings.4.0.host
#: src/data/careers.js:141
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.4.0.host"
msgid "Aya Shameimaru"
msgstr "射命丸文"

#. careerOpenings.4.0.region
#: src/data/careers.js:142
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.4.0.region"
msgid "Youkai Mountain / Airspace"
msgstr "妖怪山／全学上空"

#. careerOpenings.4.0.premise
#: src/data/careers.js:149
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.4.0.premise"
msgid "When news precedes events, retain source, original headline, correction, and reply."
msgstr "記事が事件より先に届いても、資料源・元見出し・訂正・反論権を残す。"

#. careerOpenings.4.0.duties.0
#: src/data/careers.js:151
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.4.0.duties.0"
msgid "Publish one self-caused correction daily"
msgstr "毎日、自分が原因の訂正を一件公開"

#. careerOpenings.4.0.duties.1
#: src/data/careers.js:152
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.4.0.duties.1"
msgid "Record anonymity separately from speed"
msgstr "匿名と速度を別々に記録"

#. careerOpenings.4.0.duties.2
#: src/data/careers.js:153
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.4.0.duties.2"
msgid "Retain unused but verifiable headlines"
msgstr "不採用だが検証可能な見出しを保存"

#. careerOpenings.4.0.friction
#: src/data/careers.js:155
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.4.0.friction"
msgid "Aya may profile the hire before interview and turn your correction into a faster extra."
msgstr "文は面接前に合格者記事を出し、訂正をさらに速い号外へ変えるかもしれない。"

#. careerOpenings.4.0.boundary
#: src/data/careers.js:156
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.4.0.boundary"
msgid "Photographable does not mean publishable."
msgstr "撮れることは掲載許可ではない。"

#. careerOpenings.4.0.interview
#: src/data/careers.js:157
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.4.0.interview"
msgid "Your false hiring story earned the interview. Correct it first?"
msgstr "自分の採用記事が誤報だが面接につながった。先に訂正する？"

#. careerOpenings.5.0.institution
#: src/data/careers.js:163
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.5.0.institution"
msgid "Human Village Terakoya Missing-Year Textbook Room"
msgstr "人里寺子屋・欠年教材室"

#. careerOpenings.5.0.title
#: src/data/careers.js:164
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.5.0.title"
msgid "Oral-history teacher & deleted-Wednesday tutor"
msgstr "口述史教員兼・削除水曜補講係"

#. careerOpenings.5.0.host
#: src/data/careers.js:165
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.5.0.host"
msgid "Keine Kamishirasawa / Hieda no Akyuu"
msgstr "上白沢慧音／稗田阿求"

#. careerOpenings.5.0.region
#: src/data/careers.js:166
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.5.0.region"
msgid "Human Village"
msgstr "人里"

#. careerOpenings.5.0.premise
#: src/data/careers.js:173
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.5.0.premise"
msgid "Teach three versions of one event and retain proof when Wednesday is deleted."
msgstr "同一事件の三版を教え、水曜が削除されたら補講証拠を保存。"

#. careerOpenings.5.0.duties.0
#: src/data/careers.js:175
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.5.0.duties.0"
msgid "Preserve one version you distrust"
msgstr "信じない版を一つ保存"

#. careerOpenings.5.0.duties.1
#: src/data/careers.js:176
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.5.0.duties.1"
msgid "Add a date range to a long-lived speaker's childhood"
msgstr "長命種の「子供の頃」に年代幅を付す"

#. careerOpenings.5.0.duties.2
#: src/data/careers.js:177
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.5.0.duties.2"
msgid "Catalogue people who left no writing"
msgstr "文字を残せなかった者も目録へ"

#. careerOpenings.5.0.friction
#: src/data/careers.js:179
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.5.0.friction"
msgid ""
"Keine can erase history; Akyuu wants the deletion receipt. Neither treats "
"blank as never happened."
msgstr "慧音は歴史を消せるが阿求は削除受領票を要求。空白を未発生とは認めない。"

#. careerOpenings.5.0.boundary
#: src/data/careers.js:180
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.5.0.boundary"
msgid "Withdrawn passages belong only in the closed catalogue."
msgstr "話者が削除を求めた箇所は閉架目録のみ。"

#. careerOpenings.5.0.interview
#: src/data/careers.js:181
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.5.0.interview"
msgid "A student graduates before admission. Which page do you fix first?"
msgstr "卒業年が入学年より前。どの頁を先に直す？"

#. careerOpenings.6.0.institution
#: src/data/careers.js:187
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.6.0.institution"
msgid "Myouren Temple Shared Table"
msgstr "命蓮寺・異種共同食卓"

#. careerOpenings.6.0.title
#: src/data/careers.js:188
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.6.0.title"
msgid "Adjournment, meals & de-escalation coordinator"
msgstr "閉会・食事・非激化調整"

#. careerOpenings.6.0.host
#: src/data/careers.js:189
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.6.0.host"
msgid "Byakuren Hijiri"
msgstr "聖白蓮"

#. careerOpenings.6.0.region
#: src/data/careers.js:190
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.6.0.region"
msgid "Myouren Temple"
msgstr "命蓮寺"

#. careerOpenings.6.0.premise
#: src/data/careers.js:197
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.6.0.premise"
msgid "Seat humans, youkai, and faiths together—and give the argument a real closing time."
msgstr "人間・妖怪・異なる信仰を同席させ、議論に本当の閉会時刻を持たせる。"

#. careerOpenings.6.0.duties.0
#: src/data/careers.js:199
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.6.0.duties.0"
msgid "Append dissent at the same font size"
msgstr "反対意見を本文と同じ字級で添付"

#. careerOpenings.6.0.duties.1
#: src/data/careers.js:200
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.6.0.duties.1"
msgid "Treat adjournment as facilitation work"
msgstr "閉会を進行業務へ含める"

#. careerOpenings.6.0.duties.2
#: src/data/careers.js:201
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.6.0.duties.2"
msgid "Stop the meeting continuing down residence halls"
msgstr "寮廊下での延長会を止める"

#. careerOpenings.6.0.friction
#: src/data/careers.js:203
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.6.0.friction"
msgid ""
"Three faiths may all interpret goodwill as endorsement; the night-sparrow "
"stall hears the closing bell as another order."
msgstr "善意は三信仰から同時支持と解釈され、夜雀食堂は閉会鐘を追加注文と聞く。"

#. careerOpenings.6.0.boundary
#: src/data/careers.js:204
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.6.0.boundary"
msgid "Joining dinner is not consent to recruitment."
msgstr "会食参加は勧誘同意ではない。"

#. careerOpenings.6.0.interview
#: src/data/careers.js:205
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.6.0.interview"
msgid "Three parties each demand the only gate. How do you begin adjournment?"
msgstr "三者が唯一の正門を要求。どう閉会を始める？"

#. careerOpenings.7.0.institution
#: src/data/careers.js:211
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.7.0.institution"
msgid "Moriya Wind & Festival Infrastructure Office"
msgstr "守矢神社・風祭基盤室"

#. careerOpenings.7.0.title
#: src/data/careers.js:212
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.7.0.title"
msgid "Wind, faith attribution & backup engineer"
msgstr "風力・信仰帰属・予備電源技師"

#. careerOpenings.7.0.host
#: src/data/careers.js:213
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.7.0.host"
msgid "Kanako Yasaka / Sanae Kochiya"
msgstr "八坂神奈子／東風谷早苗"

#. careerOpenings.7.0.region
#: src/data/careers.js:214
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.7.0.region"
msgid "Youkai Mountain / Moriya Shrine"
msgstr "妖怪山・守矢神社"

#. careerOpenings.7.0.premise
#: src/data/careers.js:221
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.7.0.premise"
msgid "Trace festival power, wind routes, and backup while naming who claims each miracle."
msgstr "祭典電力・風路・予備を追跡可能にし、各「神徳」の主張者を明記。"

#. careerOpenings.7.0.duties.0
#: src/data/careers.js:223
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.7.0.duties.0"
msgid "Record divine merit separately from kilowatts"
msgstr "神徳とkWを別欄へ"

#. careerOpenings.7.0.duties.1
#: src/data/careers.js:224
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.7.0.duties.1"
msgid "Test one faith-independent backup"
msgstr "信仰なしの予備を一回試験"

#. careerOpenings.7.0.duties.2
#: src/data/careers.js:225
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.7.0.duties.2"
msgid "Publish three accounts of festival ownership"
msgstr "主催権の三説を公開"

#. careerOpenings.7.0.friction
#: src/data/careers.js:227
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.7.0.friction"
msgid ""
"Kanako may treat stable power as a mandate; Sanae's Outside device may have "
"a plug that rejects Gensokyo."
msgstr "神奈子は安定電力を統治権と見なし、早苗の外界機器はプラグが幻想郷を拒む。"

#. careerOpenings.7.0.boundary
#: src/data/careers.js:228
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.7.0.boundary"
msgid "Backup cannot be another god's verbal promise."
msgstr "予備系統を別の神の口約束だけにしない。"

#. careerOpenings.7.0.interview
#: src/data/careers.js:229
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.7.0.interview"
msgid "Wind power fails at a festival; the wind god says wind is normal. Which meter?"
msgstr "祭で風力停電、風神は正常と言う。どの計器を信じる？"

#. careerOpenings.8.0.institution
#: src/data/careers.js:235
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.8.0.institution"
msgid "Hakugyokurou Half-Phantom Roll & Feast Logistics"
msgstr "白玉楼・半霊名簿と宴席物流"

#. careerOpenings.8.0.title
#: src/data/careers.js:236
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.8.0.title"
msgid "Phantom roll-call & pre-consumption inventory clerk"
msgstr "幽霊点呼兼・食前棚卸係"

#. careerOpenings.8.0.host
#: src/data/careers.js:237
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.8.0.host"
msgid "Youmu Konpaku / Yuyuko Saigyouji"
msgstr "魂魄妖夢／西行寺幽々子"

#. careerOpenings.8.0.region
#: src/data/careers.js:238
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.8.0.region"
msgid "Hakugyokurou"
msgstr "白玉楼"

#. careerOpenings.8.0.premise
#: src/data/careers.js:245
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.8.0.premise"
msgid "Separate phantoms present, passing, being eaten, and insisting they are petals."
msgstr "在席・通過・食事中・花弁だと主張する幽霊を分けて点呼。"

#. careerOpenings.8.0.duties.0
#: src/data/careers.js:247
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.8.0.duties.0"
msgid "Decide whether a half-phantom gets one or half a badge"
msgstr "半霊へ一枚か半枚の名札を決定"

#. careerOpenings.8.0.duties.1
#: src/data/careers.js:248
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.8.0.duties.1"
msgid "Call the same roll before and after dinner"
msgstr "宴席前後に同じ名簿で点呼"

#. careerOpenings.8.0.duties.2
#: src/data/careers.js:249
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.8.0.duties.2"
msgid "Retain Yuyuko's self-made fifth column"
msgstr "幽々子の自作第五欄を保存"

#. careerOpenings.8.0.friction
#: src/data/careers.js:251
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.8.0.friction"
msgid "Youmu counts seriously; Yuyuko seriously asks whether she is guest, host, or menu."
msgstr "妖夢は真剣に数え、幽々子は自分が客・主・献立のどれかを真剣に問う。"

#. careerOpenings.8.0.boundary
#: src/data/careers.js:252
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.8.0.boundary"
msgid "Do not infer the roll total from plates left after dinner."
msgstr "名簿総数を宴後の皿から逆算しない。"

#. careerOpenings.8.0.interview
#: src/data/careers.js:253
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.8.0.interview"
msgid "Does one half-phantom need one diploma or two?"
msgstr "半霊一名の卒業証書は一枚か二枚か？"

#. careerOpenings.9.0.institution
#: src/data/careers.js:259
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.9.0.institution"
msgid "Chireiden Unspoken-Evidence Room"
msgstr "地霊殿・未発話証拠室"

#. careerOpenings.9.0.title
#: src/data/careers.js:260
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.9.0.title"
msgid "Mental-privacy & fire-energy incident recorder"
msgstr "精神プライバシー・火焔能源事案記録"

#. careerOpenings.9.0.host
#: src/data/careers.js:261
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.9.0.host"
msgid "Satori Komeiji"
msgstr "古明地さとり"

#. careerOpenings.9.0.region
#: src/data/careers.js:262
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.9.0.region"
msgid "Chireiden / Blazing Hell Ruins"
msgstr "地霊殿／灼熱地獄跡"

#. careerOpenings.9.0.premise
#: src/data/careers.js:269
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.9.0.premise"
msgid "Record equipment, flame, and spoken testimony; read thoughts keep separate permissions."
msgstr "設備・炎・明示証言を記録。読まれた思考は別権限で、研究資料へ自動変換しない。"

#. careerOpenings.9.0.duties.0
#: src/data/careers.js:271
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.9.0.duties.0"
msgid "Separate reading, recording, and use"
msgstr "読取・記録・利用を三欄へ"

#. careerOpenings.9.0.duties.1
#: src/data/careers.js:272
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.9.0.duties.1"
msgid "Leave a content-free receipt for unwritten material"
msgstr "未記載内容に内容なし受領票を残す"

#. careerOpenings.9.0.duties.2
#: src/data/careers.js:273
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.9.0.duties.2"
msgid "Trigger stopping rules before energy drift expands"
msgstr "能源偏差拡大前に停止規則"

#. careerOpenings.9.0.friction
#: src/data/careers.js:275
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.9.0.friction"
msgid "Satori knows what you plan to hide but still waits for an explicit record choice."
msgstr "さとりは隠す内容を知っていても、記録するか明示選択を待つ。"

#. careerOpenings.9.0.boundary
#: src/data/careers.js:276
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.9.0.boundary"
msgid "Knowing is not research permission."
msgstr "知ることは研究利用権ではない。"

#. careerOpenings.9.0.interview
#: src/data/careers.js:277
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.9.0.interview"
msgid "Your unspoken answer was correct. Does it count?"
msgstr "未発話の正答は面接点になる？"

#. careerOpenings.10.0.institution
#: src/data/careers.js:283
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.10.0.institution"
msgid "Kourindou Outside-Object Use & Price Dispute Desk"
msgstr "香霖堂・外界物用途と値札争議机"

#. careerOpenings.10.0.title
#: src/data/careers.js:284
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.10.0.title"
msgid "Object-name, use & anachronistic pricing clerk"
msgstr "物品名・用途・時代外れ値付係"

#. careerOpenings.10.0.host
#: src/data/careers.js:285
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.10.0.host"
msgid "Rinnosuke Morichika"
msgstr "森近霖之助"

#. careerOpenings.10.0.region
#: src/data/careers.js:286
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.10.0.region"
msgid "Forest of Magic / Kourindou"
msgstr "魔法の森・香霖堂"

#. careerOpenings.10.0.premise
#: src/data/careers.js:293
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.10.0.premise"
msgid "After naming, let wear, manuals, object testimony, and price tags dispute use."
msgstr "名称判定後も摩耗・説明書・物の意見・値札で用途を争わせる。"

#. careerOpenings.10.0.duties.0
#: src/data/careers.js:295
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.10.0.duties.0"
msgid "Retain two use hypotheses per object"
msgstr "各物品に用途仮説を二つ以上"

#. careerOpenings.10.0.duties.1
#: src/data/careers.js:296
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.10.0.duties.1"
msgid "Use non-destructive tests only"
msgstr "外装を壊さない試験のみ"

#. careerOpenings.10.0.duties.2
#: src/data/careers.js:297
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.10.0.duties.2"
msgid "Record an object's refusal to be dismantled"
msgstr "分解拒否の物品意見を明記"

#. careerOpenings.10.0.friction
#: src/data/careers.js:299
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.10.0.friction"
msgid ""
"Rinnosuke may name it correctly and date its price entirely wrong; Marisa "
"writes “borrowed” outside provenance."
msgstr "霖之助は名前を正しく言い、年代を誤って値付けし得る。魔理沙は「借用」を来歴欄外へ書く。"

#. careerOpenings.10.0.boundary
#: src/data/careers.js:300
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.10.0.boundary"
msgid "Appraisal does not create ownership."
msgstr "鑑定は所有権を生まない。"

#. careerOpenings.10.0.interview
#: src/data/careers.js:301
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.10.0.interview"
msgid "You know the name; the object denies it. Whose version titles the file?"
msgstr "名前は分かるが物が否定。標題は誰の版？"

#. careerOpenings.11.0.institution
#: src/data/careers.js:307
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.11.0.institution"
msgid "Sanzu Delayed Arrival & Property Appeal Ferry"
msgstr "三途川・遅延届と物権上訴渡し場"

#. careerOpenings.11.0.title
#: src/data/careers.js:308
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.11.0.title"
msgid "Queue, fare & late-deceased appeal clerk"
msgstr "列・渡し賃・遅刻亡者申立係"

#. careerOpenings.11.0.host
#: src/data/careers.js:309
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.11.0.host"
msgid "Komachi Onozuka / Eiki Shiki"
msgstr "小野塚小町／四季映姫"

#. careerOpenings.11.0.region
#: src/data/careers.js:310
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.11.0.region"
msgid "Sanzu River / Higan"
msgstr "三途の川／彼岸"

#. careerOpenings.11.0.premise
#: src/data/careers.js:317
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.11.0.premise"
msgid "Handle ferry papers arriving after death, before judgment, or claiming auditor status."
msgstr "死亡より遅く、裁定より早く、または聴講生だと主張する渡河書類を扱う。"

#. careerOpenings.11.0.duties.0
#: src/data/careers.js:319
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.11.0.duties.0"
msgid "Separate queue time from slacking time"
msgstr "待機時間と怠業時間を分ける"

#. careerOpenings.11.0.duties.1
#: src/data/careers.js:320
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.11.0.duties.1"
msgid "Retain the prior ruling for every property appeal"
msgstr "物権上訴ごとに前裁定を保存"

#. careerOpenings.11.0.duties.2
#: src/data/careers.js:321
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.11.0.duties.2"
msgid "Find the same boat before Higan week ends"
msgstr "彼岸週終了前に同じ船を探す"

#. careerOpenings.11.0.friction
#: src/data/careers.js:323
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.11.0.friction"
msgid ""
"Komachi offers persuasive delay reasons; Eiki notes a valid reason does not "
"erase responsibility."
msgstr "小町は説得力ある遅延理由を出し、映姫は理由成立と責任消滅は別と指摘。"

#. careerOpenings.11.0.boundary
#: src/data/careers.js:324
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.11.0.boundary"
msgid "Do not average a queue into one punctual arrival."
msgstr "列の人々を平均して一人の定刻到着者にしない。"

#. careerOpenings.11.0.interview
#: src/data/careers.js:325
msgctxt "text:careerOpenings.11.0.interview"
msgid "An appeal arrives before its ruling. Is it cause or attachment?"
msgstr "申立が裁定より先に到着。前因か添付か？"

